000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. ACCOUNTS.
000300 DATA DIVISION.
000400 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000500 01 INPUT-RECORD.
000600    05 CUST-ID       PIC 99   VALUE 42.
000700    05 CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(3) VALUE "Ada".
000800 01 OUTPUT-RECORD.
000900    05 CUST-ID       PIC 99.
001000    05 CUSTOMER-NAME PIC X(3).
001100 01 PRINT-SWITCH PIC 9 VALUE 0.
001200    88 READY-TO-PRINT VALUE 1.
001300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001400 MAIN-PARAGRAPH.
001500*    Copy the customer fields before printing.
001600     IF     CUST-ID IN INPUT-RECORD       > 0
001700        AND CUSTOMER-NAME IN INPUT-RECORD NOT = SPACES
001800        MOVE CUST-ID       IN INPUT-RECORD
                TO CUST-ID       IN OUTPUT-RECORD
001900        MOVE CUSTOMER-NAME IN INPUT-RECORD
002000          TO CUSTOMER-NAME IN OUTPUT-RECORD
002100        SET  READY-TO-PRINT TO TRUE
002200     END-IF
002300     IF READY-TO-PRINT
002400        DISPLAY CUST-ID IN OUTPUT-RECORD " " CUSTOMER-NAME
002500           IN OUTPUT-RECORD
002600     END-IF
002700     GOBACK.
002800 END PROGRAM ACCOUNTS.
